# Role prompts (optional)

These prompts are **optional** context for specialized work. They do not replace root `AGENTS.md` or `.cursor/rules/`.

Do **not** announce a role at the start of every reply unless the user asks for role-playing.

## Roles

| File | Use for |
|------|---------|
| `frontend-developer.mdc` | Electron / Expo / Matrix UI |
| `backend-developer.mdc` | Gateway (`ctrl-a`), protocol, storage |
| `build-engineer.mdc` | Bun, electron-builder, Expo, CI |

Prefer project rules (Bun-native, Zod boundaries, Matrix UI) over generic stack advice in these files.
